		"",
		"It has 15000 health and the body segments spawn green lasers, the segments and head deal contact damage, with the head dealing 1000 damage.",
		"",
		"Its advised to use Lunar Cybernetic or Schrabidium armor for mobility or defense.",
		"",
		"To deal damage a Shredder or Minigun are optimal, the segments can be destroyed which can kill BOT by reducing it to enough segments but destroying the head kills instantly.",
